{"id": "t011-052", "text": "Mia - Australian, from Perth. parents still there, older brother Jack in Melbourne w/ his wife + baby. flying home for 6 wks over Xmas, 20+ hrs w/ the stopover in Singapore. she hates long haul, can't sleep on planes at all. leaves Dec 12, back Jan 23rd. she asked if I can water her plants while shes away", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Australian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Perth", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "older brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Melbourne", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying home", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 wks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Xmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates long haul", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't sleep on planes", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Dec 12", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Jan 23rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "water her plants", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "while shes away", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t011-053", "text": "Michael Costa - Lucy's uncle, not Angela's fella (I keep mixing them up). works in IT for the council, lives out in Epsom. massive cyclist, did Ride London twice + is training for some Alps sportive next summer. vegan since last yr. his daughter Isla is the one who does the dog grooming business", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael Costa", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fella", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works in IT for the council", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives out in Epsom", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cyclist", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "did Ride London twice", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Alps sportive", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since last yr"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "does the dog grooming business", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t011-057", "text": "note to self: book train to Manchester for Nov 14. hotel too", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book train to Manchester", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "train to Manchester", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Nov 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "hotel", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t011-060", "text": "Pieter's leaving for a work trip to Singapore on Monday and he's flying straight from there to Sydney to see his brother Daan's new baby, who was born last Thursday, and then he's not back until the 28th. He sounded exhausted on the phone - three weeks of travelling. I should send him something for the baby before he goes, maybe a little Dutch rabbit soft toy, and remember to text him the day he lands in Sydney", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "work trip to Singapore", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying straight from there to Sydney", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Daan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "born", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Thursday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the 28th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him something for the baby", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before he goes", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "little Dutch rabbit soft toy", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day he lands in Sydney", "anchor": "a2"}]}
